BT 1 0 0 1 0 60.5 Tm 1.139897 Tw /F2+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL (Low-code development is an approach to building software applications mainly through visual tools and) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.674524 Tw (configuration instead of writing large amounts of traditional program code. Applications are assembled) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.743853 Tw (using visual development environments, predefined components and templates. Typical building blocks) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.377901 Tw (include forms for capturing data, reports and dashboards for viewing it, and workflows that define how) Tj T* 0 Tw (information moves through a business process.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
