BT 1 0 0 1 0 60.5 Tm .916019 Tw /F2+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL (Automation is a central feature of low-code platforms. Rules, triggers and scheduled actions can perform) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.642704 Tw (repetitive tasks without manual effort. Because much of the routine programming is handled by the) Tj T* 0 Tw .921804 Tw (platform, development effort is reduced and applications can be delivered faster. Low-code platforms are) Tj T* 0 Tw .924765 Tw (also accessible to a wider group of people: professional developers use them to speed up their work, and) Tj T* 0 Tw (business users with limited programming experience can take part in building simple applications.) Tj T* ET
