BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.3 Tm .727787 Tw /F2+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL (However, low-code does not remove the need for technical understanding. Concepts such as data models,) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.416575 Tw (logic, integration and security remain important, and developers who understand programming and) Tj T* 0 Tw .933223 Tw (technical principles are better able to design applications, extend them where the platform falls short and) Tj T* 0 Tw (resolve problems when they occur.) Tj T* ET
