BT 1 0 0 1 0 88.9 Tm .910664 Tw /F2+0 10.5 Tf 14.2 TL (The Job Application Form application was built on Zoho Creator, a low-code platform. Its form captures) Tj T* 0 Tw .096656 Tw (applicant details, and the Workflow area of the platform is used to define the logic around it. In Experiment) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.047041 Tw (14, a custom Deluge function, CheckJobApplication, was created in the same application to show how a) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.476032 Tw (pro-code extension is added to a low-code application. This project is therefore a small example of the) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.013056 Tw (combination discussed in this experiment: the visual structure is built with low-code components, and) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.16543 Tw (specific logic is added through code where it is required. The function in that experiment only returns a) Tj T* 0 Tw (confirmation message, so it demonstrates the approach rather than a full career-level skill.) Tj T* ET
